  "description": "What do animals eat? Pick your answer with Milo the bluebird, then find out: a panda's food is almost all bamboo and it grips the stems with a special thumb-like bump, a koala eats almost only eucalyptus leaves and sniffs out its favorites, and a zebra snips grass with its front teeth and can drink more than a gallon of water at one time.\nAn interactive animal lesson for kids ages 2-6, with questions to answer, counting, actions to copy, quick checks and a quiz at the end.\n\nThe Animated Zoo makes gentle, colorful videos for little learners. New videos every day! Made with care for ages 2-6. Every fact is checked against trusted sources and every script is reviewed for kid safety before publishing.",
